ud","bold":true,"size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t8":{"id":"t8","x":0,"y":188,"text":"• Thermodynamica: waar ligt het evenwicht? Kinetiek: hoe snel, en via welke stappen?","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t9":{"id":"t9","x":0,"y":207,"text":"• r = dc/dt, met een min voor een reactant: de snelheid is altijd positief.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t10":{"id":"t10","x":0,"y":226,"text":"• Gemiddelde snelheid: lijn tussen twee punten. Snelheid op één tijdstip: raaklijn.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t11":{"id":"t11","x":0,"y":287,"text":"2. Snelheidsvergelijking en orde","bold":true,"size":19,"color":"#1d4ed8"},"t12":{"id":"t12","x":0,"y":315,"text":"Als je de concentratie van een stof verdubbelt, gaat de reactie dan twee keer zo snel, vier keer, of","size":13,"italic":true},"t13":{"id":"t13","x":0,"y":334,"text":"helemaal niet sneller? Dat zegt de orde. Met de orde kun je ook iets zeggen over het mechanisme.","size":13,"italic":true},"t14":{"id":"t14","x":0,"y":363,"text":"Onthoud","bold":true,"size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t15":{"id":"t15","x":0,"y":382,"text":"• r = k[A]ⁿ[B]ᵐ; totale orde = n + m.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t16":{"id":"t16","x":0,"y":401,"text":"• Verdubbel een stof van orde 1: ×2. Van orde 2: ×4. Van orde 0: ×1.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t17":{"id":"t17","x":0,"y":420,"text":"• Orde uit een proef: fⁿ = F, dus n = log F / log f.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t18":{"id":"t18","x":0,"y":481,"text":"3. Activeringsenergie en energiediagram","bold":true,"size":19,"color":"#1d4ed8"},"t19":{"id":"t19","x":0,"y":509,"text":"Ook als er bij een reactie energie vrijkomt, moeten de moleculen eerst over een drempel. Hoe hoog die","size":13,"italic":true},"t20":{"id":"t20","x":0,"y":528,"text":"drempel is, bepaalt hoe snel de reactie gaat. In een energiediagram zie je die drempel, en bij een","size":13,"italic":true},"t21":{"id":"t21","x":0,"y":547,"text":"reactie met meer stappen zie je welke stap de snelheid bepaalt.","size":13,"italic":true},"t22":{"id":"t22","x":0,"y":576,"text":"Onthoud","bold":true,"size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t23":{"id":"t23","x":0,"y":595,"text":"• Ea = top min begin. ΔG = eind min begin.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t24":{"id":"t24","x":0,"y":614,"text":"• De hoogste overgangstoestand bepaalt de snelheid.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t25":{"id":"t25","x":0,"y":633,"text":"• Uhura: Eₐ ≈ 0,7 Everbroken - 0,3 Enieuw.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t26":{"id":"t26","x":0,"y":694,"text":"4. Kinetiek van SN1, SN2, E1 en E2","bold":true,"size":19,"color":"#1d4ed8"},"t27":{"id":"t27","x":0,"y":722,"text":"Uit Organische Synthese 1 ken je substitutie en eliminatie. De cijfers 1 en 2 in SN1 en SN2 gaan over","size":13,"italic":true},"t28":{"id":"t28","x":0,"y":741,"text":"kinetiek: hoeveel deeltjes zitten er in de langzame stap? Dat lees je af aan de snelheidsvergelijking.","size":13,"italic":true},"t29":{"id":"t29","x":0,"y":770,"text":"Onthoud","bold":true,"size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t30":{"id":"t30","x":0,"y":789,"text":"• SN2 en E2: één stap, tweede orde, r hangt af van substraat én nucleofiel of base.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t31":{"id":"t31","x":0,"y":808,"text":"• SN1 en E1: twee stappen via een carbokation, eerste orde, r hangt alleen af van het substraat.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t32":{"id":"t32","x":0,"y":827,"text":"• De langzame stap van SN1 en E1 is het afsplitsen van de vertrekkende groep.","size":13,"color":"#047857"},"t33":{"id":"t33","x":0,"y":862,"text":"SN2: broommethaan + OH⁻. Links de pijlen, rechts het product, met de atomen op dezelfde plek. De drie","size":13,"bold":false},"t34":{"id":"t34","x":0,"y":881,"text":"H-atomen klappen om.","size":13,"bold":false},"t35":{"id":"t35","text":"broommethaan + OH⁻","x":24,"y":1035,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t36":{"id":"t36","text":"methanol + Br⁻","x":364,"y":1035,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t37":{"id":"t37","x":0,"y":1071.8,"text":"Waarom: Het C-atoom is δ+ omdat Br de elektronen naar zich toe trekt. Het nucleofiel (elektronenrijk)","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t38":{"id":"t38","x":0,"y":1090.8,"text":"zoekt dat C (elektronenarm). De aanval en het vertrek gebeuren tegelijk. Daarom botsen in die ene stap","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t39":{"id":"t39","x":0,"y":1109.8,"text":"twee deeltjes, en hangt de snelheid van beide concentraties af.","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t40":{"id":"t40","x":0,"y":1154.8,"text":"SN1: 2-broom-2-methylpropaan + water. Stap 2: water valt het carbokation aan.","size":13,"bold":false},"t41":{"id":"t41","text":".","x":24,"y":1193.8,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t42":{"id":"t42","text":".","x":294,"y":1393.8,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t43":{"id":"t43","text":"α","x":124,"y":1284.8,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t44":{"id":"t44","text":"snel","x":164,"y":1328.8,"color":"#d64545","italic":true,"size":12},"t45":{"id":"t45","x":0,"y":1428.2,"text":"Waarom: Een tertiair carbokation is stabiel genoeg om vanzelf te ontstaan. Dat ontstaan kost veel energie","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t46":{"id":"t46","x":0,"y":1447.2,"text":"en is dus de langzame stap. Water komt pas daarna, in een snelle stap. Wat na de langzame stap gebeurt,","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t47":{"id":"t47","x":0,"y":1466.2,"text":"heeft geen invloed op de snelheid. Daarom telt alleen het substraat.","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t48":{"id":"t48","x":0,"y":1511.2,"text":"Stap 1 (langzaam). De pijl begint in de C–Br-binding en wijst naar Br: Br neemt beide elektronen mee en","size":13,"bold":false},"t49":{"id":"t49","x":0,"y":1530.2,"text":"het α-C wordt C⁺.","size":13,"bold":false},"t50":{"id":"t50","text":".","x":24,"y":1569.2,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t51":{"id":"t51","text":".","x":294,"y":1769.2,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t52":{"id":"t52","text":"α","x":124,"y":1660.2,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t53":{"id":"t53","text":"langzaam","x":189,"y":1674.2,"color":"#d64545","italic":true,"size":12},"t54":{"id":"t54","x":0,"y":1815.6,"text":"Stap 3. Een tweede watermolecuul pakt een H van de O⁺; de pijl in de O–H-binding laat de elektronen op O","size":13,"bold":false},"t55":{"id":"t55","x":0,"y":1834.6,"text":"achter.","size":13,"bold":false},"t56":{"id":"t56","text":".","x":24,"y":1873.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t57":{"id":"t57","text":".","x":294,"y":2073.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t58":{"id":"t58","text":"α","x":124,"y":1964.6,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t59":{"id":"t59","x":0,"y":2131.6,"text":"Product. 2-Methyl-2-propanol (tert-butanol), plus H₃O⁺ en Br⁻.","size":13,"bold":false},"t60":{"id":"t60","text":".","x":24,"y":2170.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t61":{"id":"t61","text":".","x":294,"y":2370.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t62":{"id":"t62","text":"α","x":124,"y":2261.6,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t63":{"id":"t63","text":"+ H₃O⁺","x":204,"y":2355.6,"size":14},"t64":{"id":"t64","x":0,"y":2417,"text":"E2: 2-broom-2-methylpropaan + OH⁻. De H op het β-C gaat naar OH⁻, de C=C ontstaat tussen α en β, Br","size":13,"bold":false},"t65":{"id":"t65","x":0,"y":2436,"text":"vertrekt.","size":13,"bold":false},"t66":{"id":"t66","text":"α","x":53,"y":2539,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t67":{"id":"t67","text":"β","x":113,"y":2521,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t68":{"id":"t68","text":"α","x":363,"y":2539,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t69":{"id":"t69","text":"β","x":423,"y":2521,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t70":{"id":"t70","text":"2-broom-2-methylpropaan + OH⁻","x":63,"y":2623,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t71":{"id":"t71","text":"2-methylpropeen + H₂O + Br⁻","x":323,"y":2623,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t72":{"id":"t72","x":0,"y":2659.8,"text":"Waarom: Drie pijlen in één stap: base naar H, C–H-binding naar de C–C-binding, C–Br-binding naar Br.","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t73":{"id":"t73","x":0,"y":2678.8,"text":"Omdat de base in die ene stap meedoet, hangt de snelheid ook van [OH⁻] af.","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t74":{"id":"t74","x":0,"y":2723.8,"text":"Stap 2. Water gebruikt een elektronenpaar om een H van het β-C te pakken; de elektronen van die","size":13,"bold":false},"t75":{"id":"t75","x":0,"y":2742.8,"text":"C–H-binding vormen de C=C.","size":13,"bold":false},"t76":{"id":"t76","text":".","x":24,"y":2781.8,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t77":{"id":"t77","text":".","x":294,"y":2981.8,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t78":{"id":"t78","text":"α","x":124,"y":2872.8,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t79":{"id":"t79","text":"β","x":184,"y":2854.8,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t80":{"id":"t80","x":0,"y":3028.2,"text":"Product. 2-Methylpropeen en H₃O⁺.","size":13,"bold":false},"t81":{"id":"t81","text":".","x":24,"y":3067.2,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t82":{"id":"t82","text":".","x":294,"y":3267.2,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t83":{"id":"t83","text":"α","x":124,"y":3158.2,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t84":{"id":"t84","text":"β","x":184,"y":3140.2,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t85":{"id":"t85","x":0,"y":3313.6,"text":"Stap 1: Cl vertrekt met het bindingselektronenpaar. Er ontstaat een tertiair carbokation. Langzaam.","size":13,"bold":false},"t86":{"id":"t86","text":".","x":24,"y":3352.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t87":{"id":"t87","text":".","x":294,"y":3552.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t88":{"id":"t88","text":"α","x":124,"y":3443.6,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t89":{"id":"t89","text":"langzaam","x":189,"y":3457.6,"color":"#d64545","italic":true,"size":12},"t90":{"id":"t90","x":0,"y":3599,"text":"Stap 2: de O van methanol valt het C⁺ aan.","size":13,"bold":false},"t91":{"id":"t91","text":".","x":24,"y":3638,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t92":{"id":"t92","text":".","x":294,"y":3838,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t93":{"id":"t93","text":"α","x":124,"y":3729,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size"